window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>There might be no place like home, but sometimes it can be darn hard to get there.</p> <p>Gilly has been trying to get back to her realm for ages, but there are too many obstacles stand in her way.</p> <p>She finally makes it to a Fae Realm—just not the right Fae Realm. And now she's tasked with not only freeing the part-time monster who is slowly working his way into her heart, but escaping a prophecy that says she's somehow mixed up in the coming apocalypse.</p> <p>If that isn't enough, there are also vampires, a spider-herding sorceress, and an evil prince all out for her blood.</p> <p>Can she survive it all with herself and the Web intact? Or will she usher in the Great Annihilation that buries the multiverse in eternal darkness?</p> <p>Fae Wilds Series</p> <p><i>Twist &amp; Turns</i></p> <p><i>Curse of the Fae</i></p> <p><i>Force the Truth</i></p> <p><i>Crown &amp; Glory</i></p> <p><i>Enemy &amp; Rivals</i></p> <p><i>Light in the Dark</i></p> <p><i>Above the Curse</i></p> <p><i>Myths and Muses</i></p> <p><i>Chase and Hunt</i></p> <p><i>Dusk and Shadows</i></p> <p><i>Called by Midnight</i></p> <p><i>Dark Memories</i></p> <p><i>USA Today</i> best-selling author, W.J. May creates a new paranormal series with a world of Fae and Magic. Escape into a realm of fantasy creatures, love and deception, betrayal and jealousy.</p>"; 
